/* Fovea — app: menus, the menu bar, alerts, shared names (FoveaApp, FoveaKit, FoveaPlatform). Simplified Chinese. Keys: Localization/README.md. */

/* Shortcuts (FoveaKeys) */
"Voice Flow" = "听写";
"Speak, and Fovea types it into the app in front of you." = "开口说话，Fovea 会把文字输入到当前 App 中。";
"Dispatch" = "派发";
"Send what you say, and what you point at, to Claude Code or Codex." = "把你说的话和你指向的内容一起发给 Claude Code 或 Codex。";
"Take part of the screen" = "截取部分屏幕";
"Press ⌘, then drag over what to take. Hold ⌘ to take more than one." = "按下 ⌘，然后拖动选择要截取的区域。按住 ⌘ 可连续截取多处。";
"Take the whole screen" = "截取全屏";
"Press ⌘ twice." = "按两下 ⌘。";
"Take words or a file" = "选取文字或文件";
"While Fovea listens, select words, or drag a file onto the notch. No key needed." = "Fovea 聆听时，直接选中文字，或把文件拖到灵动岛上，无需按键。";
"Every chat" = "所有会话";
"In Choose chat, press left ⌃ by itself for every chat by agent." = "在“选择会话”中单独按下左侧 ⌃，可按 Agent 查看所有会话。";
"Step back or cancel" = "返回或取消";
"Closes what's open, or cancels while Fovea listens." = "关闭当前打开的内容；Fovea 聆听时按下则取消。";
"Undo a cancel" = "撤销刚才的取消";
"For a moment after you cancel." = "取消后短时间内可用。";

